loom doc=docs/CRYPTO.md bytes_before=69099 bytes_after=9078 lines_before=311 lines_after=150
file tools/fixtures/declared_ceiling_scan.sh discovers every living tracked .md declaring a ceiling, parses the number, measures the page, gates over-ceiling and unreadable at zero, ratchets the title-grade form
file tools/fixtures/declared_ceiling_control.sh thirteen behaviors across nineteen assertions on real pages in a throwaway pen, both ceilings shown from both sides, the refusal proven to name the page
file tools/d/declared_ceiling_witness.rish the 50th standing guard, asserting the census verdict and every planted behavior by name
file docs/CRYPTO.md compressed 69,099 to 9,078 bytes -- the rung table replaced by a routing table to the record that already holds all 87 rows
file docs/README.md 43 to 39 lines, STOA.md listed, grade column retired, plain ASCII
file construction/REDS.md rows %195 and %196 booked; rows %193 and %194 folded to archive as the pin passed its bound; headline updated to the measured spine
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri declared_ceiling seated 50th
file construction/ITINERARY.md guard count 50, Now refilled, the Ceiling reading closed, the Git nib line condensed, the card's own size booked
file tools/fixtures/prose_register_scan.sh docs/README.md joins the DOOR roster, reading 0% against a 20% ceiling
recommend keep-going the index fold for four rooms is the next crux -- active-designing 86 stale rows, counsel 112, expanding-prompts 78, waymarks 41, 317 together under a ceiling that only falls, and each is its own round since folding a room's index also rewrites its front door. Beside it stands docs/STOA.md at 166 lines against the <=80 it declares in its own title, now the one page riding the new guard's ratchet, and this card at 47,188 bytes against a 24,576 bound it has now grown back past twice.
